- initialize_hash_function: calls seed_state(ctx)
- prf_addr: copies precomputed sha256 state, finalizes with addr || sk_seed
- gen_message_random: implements HMAC-SHA-X (X = 256 or 512 depending on SPX_SHA512)
  - Inner: SHA-X(ipad_key || optrand || m)
  - Outer: SHA-X(opad_key || inner_hash)
- hash_message: SHA-X(R || pk || m), then MGF1-SHA-X(R || pk_seed || sha_output)

For the conditional SHA-256 vs SHA-512, use the SPX_SHA512 constant from params:
```rust
if SPX_SHA512 { /* use sha512 variants */ } else { /* use sha256 variants */ }
